# Files in the repo that must NOT be published by Cloudflare static assets.
# (Build scripts, internal reports and the font mock-up were publicly reachable
#  and indexable; font-mockup.html also carried a canonical pointing at /index.html.)
.git
.gitignore
.abacus.donotdelete
*.py
*.md
*.pdf
*.docx
tailwind.config.js
tools/
node_modules/
font-mockup.html
